factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The headline and reel_script say the car hit the moped (கார் மோதி) in Ponnammapettai, but the article says the accident happened after she left Salem New Bus Stand; the location of the crash itself is not stated in the article, so placing it in Ponnammapettai is an unsupported location claim.
  The reel_script and slides say she was 'இரண்டு மாதங்களில்' / '2 மாதங்களில்' retiring, which matches the article, but the slide says 'சேலம் அரசு மருத்துவமனையில் சிகிச்சை பெற்றார்' and the reel_script says she 'உயிரிழந்தார்' at the government hospital; the article says she died at the government hospital yesterday, which is consistent, but the caption's '📍' location line is fine.
  The slide 'வாகன ஓட்டிகள் சாலையில் கவனமாக இருங்கள்' (drivers should be careful on the road) is an advisory not present in the article.
  The slide 'விபத்து குறித்த விவரங்கள் சேகரிக்கப்படுகின்றன' (accident details are being collected) is a paraphrase beyond the article's 'விசாரித்து வருகின்றனர'; it is a minor addition not stated in the article.
  The slide 'மகளுடன் சென்ற 60 வயது புஷ்பா கீழே விழுந்தார்' omits that she was on a moped with her daughter as the rider context and mixes details; the article says she was travelling with her daughter on the moped, which the slide reflects, so this is acceptable but the slide 'சேலம் புது பஸ் ஸ்டாண்ட் அருகே' says 'near' while the article says she departed from the bus stand, a location change.
